<div class="weekly-table-wrap"><table class="weekly-table"><thead><tr><th>Organization</th><th>Reported response</th><th>Evidence level</th><th>Unverified</th></tr></thead><tbody>
<tr><td>Visa, BILL, Billtrust, 20 Oct<sup><a href="#s2">2</a></sup></td><td>Agent pays buyer-approved invoices.</td><td>Live pilot; participants unnamed.</td><td>Binding to amount and payee; rejection data.</td></tr>
<tr><td>Mastercard, 20 Oct<sup><a href="#s3">3</a></sup></td><td>Signed payment vouchers within an approved budget.</td><td>Named pilots; Early Access.</td><td>Refusal of an over-budget voucher.</td></tr>
<tr><td>ServiceNow with NVIDIA, 21 Oct<sup><a href="#s4">4</a></sup></td><td>Runtime policy enforcement for its Arc agent.</td><td>Generally available; Passport enforcement planned.</td><td>Argument-level control; bypass tests.</td></tr>
