<div class="weekly-check"><div class="weekly-check-name">Check 01 / Agent payments</div><dl><dt>Action</dt><dd>Payments your agent signs.</dd><dt>Defect to test</dt><dd>The signer accepts a counterparty's amount without checking the approved limit.</dd><dt>Effective control</dt><dd>An over-limit request is refused before signing, and the refusal is recorded.</dd></dl></div>
<div class="weekly-check"><div class="weekly-check-name">Check 02 / Unattended sessions</div><dl><dt>Action</dt><dd>Writes to approval config or SSH files.</dd><dt>Defect to test</dt><dd>The gate matches command text, so unlisted write methods pass.</dd><dt>Effective control</dt><dd>Denials by target path for every write method tested, with the files unchanged.</dd></dl></div>
<h3>Watch list</h3><ul class="weekly-watch"><li>Hermes Agent: a released fix.</li><li>ServiceNow: AI Passport enforcement availability.</li><li>Walmart: the Agent Profiles launch.</li></ul>
